{
  "file": "module1",
  "page": 22,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        66.30284118652344,
        236.09176635742188,
        84.57283782958984
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        91.27869415283203,
        527.4359741210938,
        105.72169494628906
      ],
      "text": "TB is the most frequent cause of AIDS-related deaths worldwide, despite progress in access to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.20270538330078,
        527.4364624023438,
        118.92170715332031
      ],
      "text": "(19) antiretroviral treatment (ART)  . TB caused about 167 000 deaths among people with HIV in 2022,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.40271759033203,
        527.3549194335938,
        132.12171936035156
      ],
      "text": "(10) representing about one third of all HIV deaths  . Globally, people with HIV are about 18 times more",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.98098373413086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        130.8787384033203,
        349.56512451171875,
        145.3217315673828
      ],
      "text": "likely to develop TB disease than those without HIV infection.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        151.3065948486328,
        527.4263916015625,
        167.0255889892578
      ],
      "text": "(20) Recommendation 1 , to give TPT to all people with HIV, was first published by WHO in 2011  . A",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        165.78260803222656,
        527.4201049804688,
        180.22560119628906
      ],
      "text": "systematic review of 12 randomized controlled trials (RCTs) found that preventive treatment reduced",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        178.9827423095703,
        527.533935546875,
        193.4257354736328
      ],
      "text": "the overall risk for TB by 33% (relative risk [RR] 0.67, 95% confidence interval [CI] 0.51; 0.87) among the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.958271026611328,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        190.90663146972656,
        527.4293823242188,
        206.62562561035156
      ],
      "text": "(21) 8578 people with HIV included in the trial  . For those who were tuberculin skin test (TST) positive,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.3826446533203,
        527.3924560546875,
        219.8256378173828
      ],
      "text": "the reduction increased to 64% (RR 0.36, 95% CI 0.22; 0.61). Although not statistically significant, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.58265686035156,
        527.4271850585938,
        233.02565002441406
      ],
      "text": "reduction was 14% among TST-negative people (RR 0.86, 95% CI 0.59 ; 1.26) and those of unknown",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        231.7826690673828,
        527.4156494140625,
        246.2256622314453
      ],
      "text": "TST status (RR 0.86, 95% CI 0.48 ; 1.52). Most of the studies in the review were, however, conducted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        244.98255920410156,
        527.3936767578125,
        259.4255676269531
      ],
      "text": "before ART became available, and there is now increasing evidence from observational studies and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.1826171875,
        527.4718627929688,
        272.6256408691406
      ],
      "text": "RCTs of the efficacy of TPT in people receiving ART. TB incidence has been reported to be high among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973267555236816,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        271.38262939453125,
        527.4365844726562,
        285.8256530761719
      ],
      "text": "all people with HIV who did not receive isoniazid preventive treatment (IPT), including those with a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.30657958984375,
        527.41845703125,
        299.0256652832031
      ],
      "text": "(22)  and who were TST negative  . A double-blinded RCT of 1329 people  CD4 cell count > 350/mm 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.7825927734375,
        527.4312133789062,
        312.2256164550781
      ],
      "text": "with HIV receiving ART found that the effect of IPT was not statistically significantly different between",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        309.70648193359375,
        527.4295654296875,
        325.4255065917969
      ],
      "text": "(23) those who were positive or negative on TST or IGRA  . An RCT of 2056 people with HIV showed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        322.9066162109375,
        527.4215698242188,
        338.6256408691406
      ],
      "text": "(24,25) additive benefits of TPT plus ART in reducing both TB incidence and overall mortality  . Early",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        337.3825988769531,
        527.2573852539062,
        351.82562255859375
      ],
      "text": "initiation of ART and 6 months of IPT independently resulted in a risk of severe HIV-related illness that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987743377685547,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        350.5826110839844,
        527.454345703125,
        365.025634765625
      ],
      "text": "was 44% lower and a risk of death from any cause that was 35% lower than the risks with deferred",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        363.7825927734375,
        388.0469665527344,
        378.22564697265625
      ],
      "text": "years. initiation of ART and no IPT. The protective effect lasted for > 5",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86618041992188,
        385.4864807128906,
        527.50830078125,
        399.92950439453125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG at that time reviewed the evidence from the systematic reviews and discussed each",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86618041992188,
        398.6864929199219,
        527.379638671875,
        413.1295166015625
      ],
      "text": "population risk group identified for the prevalence of TBI, risk of progression to TB disease and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86618041992188,
        411.8865051269531,
        527.4421997070312,
        426.32952880859375
      ],
      "text": "incidence of TB disease as compared with that in the general population. They concluded that the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86618041992188,
        425.0865173339844,
        527.435546875,
        439.529541015625
      ],
      "text": "evidence shows a clear benefit of systematic testing and treatment of TBI for people with HIV. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86618041992188,
        438.2865295410156,
        527.4625244140625,
        452.72955322265625
      ],
      "text": "wording of the current recommendation refers to TBI testing rather than TST as IGRA, and the new",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86618041992188,
        451.37652587890625,
        527.4196166992188,
        465.9295654296875
      ],
      "text": "recommendations 17 and 18 ). TPT  antigen-based skin tests (TBST) are alternative options (see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        464.6864929199219,
        527.4119873046875,
        479.1295166015625
      ],
      "text": "should be given to adults and adolescents with HIV, regardless of their immune status and whether",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        477.8865051269531,
        527.5115966796875,
        492.32952880859375
      ],
      "text": "they are on ART, given the evidence of a protective effect additional to that of ART. A systematic review",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96584701538086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        491.0865173339844,
        527.4069213867188,
        505.529541015625
      ],
      "text": "of studies conducted before ART became available showed the value of providing TPT immediately",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        504.2864990234375,
        527.4432373046875,
        518.7294921875
      ],
      "text": "after successful completion of TB treatment among people with HIV in countries with a TB incidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        516.2105102539062,
        527.4952392578125,
        531.9295043945312
      ],
      "text": "(26,27) > 100/100 000 population  . Since 2011, TPT has been recommended for children with HIV who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.97697639465332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        530.6865234375,
        527.3858642578125,
        545.1295166015625
      ],
      "text": "were previously treated for TB (see next section). No evidence was found, however, for preventive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        543.886474609375,
        527.5690307617188,
        558.3294677734375
      ],
      "text": "treatment of people who had successfully completed treatment for MDR- or extensively drug-resistant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9653959274292,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        557.0865478515625,
        527.5258178710938,
        571.529541015625
      ],
      "text": "TB. The effect of repeated courses of TPT is also unclear due to lack of evidence, and hence no",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        569.010498046875,
        527.5127563476562,
        584.7294921875
      ],
      "text": "(28) recommendation was made  . The relative risk of TB transmission is determined by local authorities",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.97852897644043,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        583.4865112304688,
        527.2376708984375,
        597.9295043945312
      ],
      "text": "on the basis of risk of exposure (e.g. TB incidence, occurrence of undiagnosed or inadequately treated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974570274353027,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        595.4105224609375,
        455.6502990722656,
        611.1295166015625
      ],
      "text": "(29) disease, population density, environmental factors) and host immune response  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        618.390380859375,
        527.5763549804688,
        632.8333740234375
      ],
      "text": "Pregnant women with HIV are at risk for TB, which can have severe consequences for both the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        630.3143920898438,
        527.4212646484375,
        646.0333862304688
      ],
      "text": "(30) mother and the fetus, with increased risks of maternal and infant death  . Pregnancy should not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        644.79052734375,
        527.435546875,
        659.2335205078125
      ],
      "text": "disqualify women with HIV from receiving TPT with medicines commonly used to treat TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        657.990478515625,
        527.3789672851562,
        672.4334716796875
      ],
      "text": "that are generally considered safe for use in pregnancy, such as isoniazid and rifampicin (classified",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        669.9144287109375,
        415.63128662109375,
        685.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "(31,32) as pregnancy category C by the US Food and Drug Administration  ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        415.48419189453125,
        671.1904296875,
        465.60009765625,
        685.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "Section 1.4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        465.6070861816406,
        671.1904296875,
        527.4169921875,
        685.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "presents the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86614990234375,
        684.390380859375,
        237.20230102539062,
        698.8333740234375
      ],
      "text": "position on use of TPT in pregnancy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        704.8184204101562,
        527.3272094726562,
        720.5374145507812
      ],
      "text": "(20) Recommendations 2–4  were first published by WHO in 2011  . A systematic review conducted for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.98293685913086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        719.29443359375,
        527.070068359375,
        733.7374267578125
      ],
      "text": "establishing the original guidelines included two studies, both conducted in South Africa. One suggested",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        732.494384765625,
        527.3695678710938,
        746.9373779296875
      ],
      "text": "a considerable reduction in mortality and protection against TB among HIV-infected children who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        744.4183959960938,
        527.4219970703125,
        760.1373901367188
      ],
      "text": "(33) received isoniazid for 6 months  . The other, however, showed no benefit of preventive treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        758.8944091796875,
        527.4556884765625,
        773.33740234375
      ],
      "text": "in infants in whom HIV infection was identified in the first 3–4 months of life, who had no known",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        43.29376983642578,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "4 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43409729003906,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.05807495117188,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06536865234375,
        801.0170288085938,
        390.6751403808594,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: tuberculosis preventive treatment, second edition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}